{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18571","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泾水黄，陇野茫。\n负太白，腾天狼。\n有鸟鸷立，羽翼张。\n鈎喙决前，钜趯傍。\n怒飞饥啸，翾不可当。\n老雄死，子复良。\n巢岐饮渭，肆翱翔。\n顿地紘，提天纲。\n列缺掉帜，招摇耀鋩。\n鬼神来助，梦嘉祥。\n脑涂原野，魄飞扬。\n星辰复，恢一方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}